  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and actuation: all uncontrollable obstacle and path_clear events, and all controllable motion commands. The specification enforces safe, conservative obstacle recovery, prioritizes random_walk and move_forward for coverage, and ensures that after any obstacle, a recovery turn is performed before resuming exploration. Full_rotate is reserved for repeated or dead-end obstacles. All states are total on uncontrollables, and only one controllable is enabled per state to avoid oscillation.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant for robot's combined perception and motion capabilities.",
    "Specification automaton encodes safe exploration, conservative recovery, and quick return to coverage, with strict alternation between exploration and recovery."
